1
00:00:01,280 --> 00:00:02,080
Reading

2
00:00:04,120 --> 00:00:07,080
How Daisy Learned to Help Wildlife

3
00:00:09,440 --> 00:00:13,140
Daisy had always longed to help endangered species of wildlife.

4
00:00:13,960 --> 00:00:17,960
One day she woke up and found a flying carpet by her bed.

5
00:00:19,480 --> 00:00:22,860
Where do you want to go?" it asked.

6
00:00:23,800 --> 00:00:25,340
Daisy responded immediately.

7
00:00:26,180 --> 00:00:30,700
I’d like to see some endangered wildlife," she said.

8
00:00:31,360 --> 00:00:35,260
Please take me to a distant land where I can find the animal

9
00:00:35,260 --> 00:00:40,640
that gave fur to make this sweater." At once the carpet flew away

10
00:00:40,640 --> 00:00:41,860
and took her to Tibet.

11
00:00:42,920 --> 00:00:45,700
There Daisy saw an antelope looking sad.

12
00:00:46,200 --> 00:00:50,860
It said, "We’re being killed for the wool beneath our stomachs.

13
00:00:50,860 --> 00:00:55,320
Our fur is being used to make sweaters for people like you.

14
00:00:55,660 --> 00:01:01,500
As a result, we are now an endangered species." At that Daisy cried, "

15
00:01:02,920 --> 00:01:05,420
I’m sorry I didn’t know that.

16
00:01:06,360 --> 00:01:09,340
I wonder what is being done to help you.

17
00:01:09,640 --> 00:01:14,160
Flying carpet, please show me a place where there’s some wildlife protection."

18
00:01:15,760 --> 00:01:17,680
The flying carpet travelled

19
00:01:17,680 --> 00:01:21,140
so fast that next minute they were in Zimbabwe.

20
00:01:22,340 --> 00:01:25,600
Daisy turned around and found that she was being watched by an elephant.

21
00:01:26,860 --> 00:01:33,860
Have you come to take my photo?" it asked.In relief Daisy burst into laughter.

22
00:01:34,860 --> 00:01:37,700
Don’t laugh,"said the elephant, "

23
00:01:38,920 --> 00:01:40,920
We used to be an endangered species.

24
00:01:41,520 --> 00:01:43,520
Farmers hunted us without mercy.

25
00:01:43,520 --> 00:01:46,000
They said we destroyed their farms,

26
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:49,660
and money from tourists only went to the large tour companies.

27
00:01:50,520 --> 00:01:52,280
So the government decided to help.

28
00:01:53,360 --> 00:01:56,640
They allowed tourists to hunt only a certain number of animals

29
00:01:56,640 --> 00:01:58,020
if they paid the farmers.

30
00:01:59,080 --> 00:02:02,080
Now the farmers are happy and our numbers are increasing.

31
00:02:02,780 --> 00:02:08,960
So good things are being done here to save local wildlife." Daisy smiled.

32
00:02:10,080 --> 00:02:11,240
That’s good news.

33
00:02:11,240 --> 00:02:14,500
It shows the importance of wildlife protection,

34
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:21,860
but I’d like to help as the WWF suggests." The carpet rose again

35
00:02:21,860 --> 00:02:25,280
and almost at once they were in a thick rainforest.

36
00:02:26,160 --> 00:02:28,500
A monkey watched them as it rubbed itself.

37
00:02:29,980 --> 00:02:32,740
What are you doing?" asked Daisy.

38
00:02:34,020 --> 00:02:38,100
I’m protecting myself from mosquitoes," it replied.

39
00:02:38,100 --> 00:02:41,320
When I find a millipede insect,

40
00:02:41,560 --> 00:02:43,280
I rub it over my body.

41
00:02:43,940 --> 00:02:46,920
It contains a powerful drug which affects mosquitoes.

42
00:02:48,040 --> 00:02:51,480
You should pay more attention to the rainforest where I live

43
00:02:51,480 --> 00:02:54,440
and appreciate how the animals live together.

44
00:02:55,140 --> 00:03:01,700
No rainforest, no animals, no drugs." Daisy was amazed.

45
00:03:02,820 --> 00:03:09,400
Flying carpet, please take me home so I can tell WWF and we can begin producing this new drug.

46
00:03:10,100 --> 00:03:14,140
Monkey, please come and help." The monkey agreed.

47
00:03:14,860 --> 00:03:16,400
The carpet flew home.

48
00:03:16,800 --> 00:03:19,460
As they landed, things began to disappear.

49
00:03:20,600 --> 00:03:23,640
Two minutes later everything had gone - the monkey,

50
00:03:23,640 --> 00:03:24,160
too.

51
00:03:25,080 --> 00:03:27,760
So Daisy was not able to make her new drug.

52
00:03:27,960 --> 00:03:29,700
But what an experience!

53
00:03:30,740 --> 00:03:33,080
She had learned so much!

54
00:03:33,080 --> 00:03:35,840
And there was always WWF ...
